    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "counselors just tell me to \"practice resilience\" or \"self-care\" like that's gonna change the fact that people are objectively suffering and i'm just a band-aid. it's more than just being tired. it's the realization that the struggle itself is the problem. maybe the only way to actually stop the noise is to just... stop. to stop trying to fight a tide that's never gonna turn. it feels like there's no real answer except just letting go of the whole thing.",
